    },
    {
      "id": "g9",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "G9｜流程 / Agent / 调度稳定\n\n674-115 / 674-116：IN PROGRESS\nLinear→Canvas 状态对账：已发现并修复一批同步债\nIMG-SMOKE-01：PASS\n规则：每小时收束必须同步 Linear → MD/证据 → Canvas → Next Action\n新增门禁：状态变更只有 canvas_sync=PASS + commit_sha 才算完整闭环",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "qchar001",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Q-CHAR-001｜头像稳定扩展到中全景\n\n状态：ACTIVE / PARTIAL_CLOSED\nR1：79头像 baseline CLEAR\nQ-CHAR-001.1：DONE\nQ-CHAR-001.4：DONE\nQ-CHAR-001.3：REJECTED（不占 Canvas 正式节点）\nAVATAR-PROBLEM-SYSTEM-v1：FROZEN\nCURRENT：继续处理头像→四宫格→中全景/全身→多姿态→连续镜头的剩余稳定链\nCH-004：真实案例",
      "x": 980,
